  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed the Taqueria Luz order to a specialist (reference **ESC-700**). They'll check whether the 5:50 PM notification actually reached your phone and will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide. Burger Barn stays as it is for now.\n\n**Summer rolls from Pho Real (K-6502):** You're within the 48-hour window for reporting missing items, which ends at 7:45 PM tonight. The restaurant didn't mark the summer rolls unavailable or refund them automatically, so you can be compensated for them. The rolls cost $9.00.\n\nThe $5.00 late-delivery credit I added earlier was also on this order. Our policy says anything already given on an order gets subtracted from what's owed for a new problem on the same order. So your options are:\n\n1. **$4.00 refund to your Visa ending 4242.** That's $9.00 minus the $5.00 already credited.\n2. **$5.80 in account credit.** That's $10.80 (the $9.00 price plus 20%) minus the $5.00 already credited.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks for passing Taqueria Luz to the specialist. I'll wait for their follow-up.\n\nFor the summer rolls, I'd like the account credit, please. I'd rather not have the money go back to my Visa.\n\nCould you confirm that the $5.80 will show up on my account today?"
