  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes. The $5.80 credit for the missing summer rolls is on your account now, not later today. **Your credit balance is $35.80.** It will apply to your next orders.\n\nHere's a summary of everything from today:\n- **Saffron Lane (K-6501):** $25.00 credit because it arrived 52 minutes late\n- **Pho Real (K-6502):** $5.00 credit because it arrived 30 minutes late, plus $5.80 credit for the missing summer rolls\n- **Taqueria Luz (K-6503):** a specialist is reviewing it (reference ESC-700) and will follow up within 24 hours\n- **Burger Barn (K-6504):** no change for now. If you find a record of contacting us about it earlier, just let us know.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that covers it. I appreciate you sorting out the Saffron Lane and summer rolls credits. I'll keep an eye out for the specialist's follow-up on Taqueria Luz (ESC-700), and I'll check my notes on Burger Barn. That's everything for now."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Monique. Your $35.80 credit is ready for your next order, and the specialist will follow up within 24 hours about Taqueria Luz (ESC-700). If your notes turn up anything on Burger Barn, just let us know.\n\nI'm sorry about all the late deliveries this week. Have a good evening and enjoy your next meal!"
